ent; see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/AnyGenerationOptions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a recipe whose types are chosen at run time. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defaults reproduce the plain generation of earlier versions: order 1, at most 100 note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events, starting at the source’s opening and stopping where it ends."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The options are applied in this order: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/mixing-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/order","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" alone), then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/constraints-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/contrast","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/backsOff","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template\/GenerationOptions\/loops","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". A template that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"separates pitch and duration generates from its two chains in step: the duration chain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chooses each event’s duration and whether it is a rest, and the pitch chain chooses the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"te